msgstr "そのまま上る"

msgctxt "woh_event:1172"
msgid "[click anywhere to continue]"
msgstr "（画面をクリックしてください）"

msgctxt "woh_event:1173"
msgid "ACCESS YOUR STORAGE"
msgstr "カバンを開ける"

msgctxt "woh_go:0"
msgid "SHIOKAWA SCHOOL"
msgstr "異界へ繋ぐ学び舎"

msgctxt "woh_go:1"
msgid ""
"As you near the gym hall, the chanting and rhythmic drums grow louder, threatening to intoxicate you.\n"
"You creak the door open and stifle a scream. The entire school is gathered around a huge portal surrounded by black candles. From within, the bellowing of the beast being summoned echoes.\n"
"The teacher stands at the front, covered in a purple robe, her true form revealed..."
msgstr ""
"呪文の詠唱と、リズミカルに鳴り響く太鼓の音。\n"
"体育館に近づくにつれて、次第にその音も大きくなり、\n"
"思わずあなたも幻惑されそうになる。\n"
"\n"
"軋むドアを開けた途端、あなたは悲鳴が出そうになるのを何とか押し殺した。\n"
"黒い蝋燭に囲まれた巨大な異界の扉…その周りに全生徒が集まっていたのだ。\n"
"異界から召喚された獣の唸り声が響き渡る。\n"
"あの後任の先生が紫のローブに身を包み、前方に立っている。\n"
"そして、彼女の真の姿が露わとなった…"

msgctxt "woh_go:2"
msgid "The school building has become a portal to an unknown place. Close it before it's too late!"
msgstr ""
"校舎に、未知なる世界へとつながる扉が\n"
"開いてしまった。\n"
"手遅れになる前に閉じなくては！"

msgctxt "woh_go:3"
msgid "KNOWLEDGE IS POWER"
msgstr "知は力なり"

msgctxt "woh_go:4"
msgid "The portal grows bigger..."
msgstr "異界の扉がどんどんと広がっていく…"

msgctxt "woh_go:5"
msgid "The school shakes..."
msgstr "校舎全体が揺れる…"

msgctxt "woh_go:6"
msgid "The portal is pulling you in..."
msgstr "異界の扉に引きずり込まれる…"

msgctxt "woh_go:7"
msgid "GORE-COVERED STUDENT"
msgstr "血肉にまみれた生徒"

msgctxt "woh_go:8"
msgid "Suddenly, the teacher's chest rips apart, showering the classroom with gore. From within, a child coated in meat and intestines leaps out, screeching with joy!"
msgstr ""
"突然、彼の胸部が引き裂かれ、教室に血の雨が降り注ぐ。\n"
"中から肉片と内臓にまみれた子供が飛び出し、歓喜の声を上げた！"

msgctxt "woh_go:9"
msgid "How did she end up in that teacher's stomach?"
msgstr "どうやって、先生のお腹に入ったんだ？"

msgctxt "woh_go:10"
msgid "GORE-COVERED STUDENT attacks you!"
msgstr "“血肉にまみれた生徒”の攻撃！"

msgctxt "woh_go:11"
msgid "GORE-COVERED STUDENT stabs you!"
msgstr "“血肉にまみれた生徒”に刺される！"

msgctxt "woh_go:12"
msgid "GORE-COVERED STUDENT kicks you!"
msgstr "“血肉にまみれた生徒”の蹴りを食らう！"

msgctxt "woh_go:13"
msgid "TRAGIC TALE OF THE THAUMATURGY TEACHER"
msgstr "暗夜に響く妖しき教師の哀れな叫び"

msgctxt "woh_go:14"
msgid ""
"2-B used to be one of the most outstanding classes in the school.\n"
"\n"
"At least before their teacher's disappearance."
msgstr ""
"かつての2-Bは、学内でもトップレベルに\n"
"優秀なクラスとして知られていた。\n"
"\n"
"彼らの担任教師が失踪するまでは…"

msgctxt "woh_go:15"
msgid "Her replacement glides through the school, entrancing all those around her with her soft voice and calming emotionless eyes."
msgstr ""
"彼女の後任が滑らかに校内を歩く。\n"
"\n"
"その柔らかな声と無感情で冷たい瞳が、\n"
"周囲の者たちを妖しく惹き付けている。"

msgctxt "woh_go:16"
msgid ""
"Now, she stands at the front of the class, scribbling occult symbols in chalk and hissing lessons about the old gods.\n"
"\n"
"The children no longer play, but sit in their seats until dark, chanting along. Learning of their eldritch masters and preparing to serve them…"
msgstr ""
"そして今、彼女は教壇に立ち、黒板に\n"
"チョークを走らせ、奇妙な印を描いていた。\n"
"語気荒く、旧き神についての授業をしている。\n"
"生徒たちは遊ぶことも止め、暗くなるまで\n"
"席に座り、全員一緒になって\n"
"呪文を唱え続けていた。\n"
"\n"
"彼らは、彼女の教えを受けながら\n"
"「怪魔の主」に仕える準備を進めていたのだ…"

msgctxt "woh_go:17"
msgid "Following a rumor, you visit the house of a schoolgirl who acted really strange in class."
msgstr ""
"ある女子生徒が授業中に\n"
"奇妙な行動をとっていた\n"
"という噂を聞き付け、\n"
"あなたはその生徒の家を\n"
"訪ねることにした。"

msgctxt "woh_go:18"
msgid "The girl's parents sit crying in the living room, and fearfully point you upstairs."
msgstr ""
"彼女の両親が\n"
"リビングで泣いている。\n"
"そして、恐る恐る\n"
"上の階を指差した。"

msgctxt "woh_go:19"
msgid ""
"She sits in her bedroom in a bloodstained uniform, a dead rat lying in her hands.\n"
"\n"
"Asked why she killed it, she just grins."
msgstr ""
"階段を上がると、あの生徒がいた。\n"
"血で汚れた制服を身にまとい、\n"
"死んだネズミを持ちながら\n"
"自分の寝室で座っている。\n"
"なぜ殺したのかと尋ねるも、\n"
"彼女はただにっこりと\n"
"笑うだけであった。"

msgctxt "woh_go:20"
msgid "Another lead, the former teacher of the class may prove more useful."
msgstr ""
"もう一つの情報源…\n"
"\n"
"前の担任であれば、\n"
"何か良い情報を\n"
"持っているかもしれない。"

msgctxt "woh_go:21"
msgid ""
"Knocking on their door, however, gets you no answer.\n"
"\n"
"Just subtle chittering behind the door."
msgstr ""
"しかし、あなたが部屋のドアを\n"
"ノックしても返事がなかった。\n"
"\n"
"ドアの向こうから、\n"
"何かガチガチと震える音が\n"
"するだけだ。"

msgctxt "woh_go:22"
msgid "A little boy from the school has been attacked by his classmates."
msgstr ""
"学校のある男子生徒が、\n"
"同級生たちに襲われたらしい。"

msgctxt "woh_go:23"
msgid ""
"You find him in the hospital covered in bites.\n"
"\n"
"Just what is with this whole 'summoning' that he speaks of between his sobs?"
msgstr ""
"あなたは病院で、\n"
"その生徒を見つけた。\n"
"全身、噛み傷だらけだ。\n"
"\n"
"彼が泣きじゃくりながら\n"
"語る「召喚」とは一体…？"

msgctxt "woh_go:24"
msgid "With no other ideas, you decide to wait outside the school itself."
msgstr ""
"他に案もなかったので、\n"
"学校の外で待つことにした。"

msgctxt "woh_go:25"
msgid "The faint chanting doesn't stop and no one enters or leaves the building."
msgstr ""
"かすかに聞こえる詠唱は\n"
"止まず、誰一人として校舎を\n"
"出入りする様子もない。"

msgctxt "woh_go:26"
msgid "You hear a scream coming from the school! It's time to enter…"
msgstr ""
"校内から悲鳴が聞こえてきた！\n"
"もう突入するしかない…"

msgctxt "woh_go:27"
msgid "THE LESION LESSON"
msgstr "血を伴う知識"

msgctxt "woh_go:28"
msgid ""
"Climbing a tree, you get a better view of the class.\n"
"Weird schematics of some portal drawn on the blackboard could help in the future."
msgstr ""
"木を登ると、教室の中がよく見えた。\n"
"黒板に“異界の扉”の略図が描かれている…後々、役に立つかもしれない。"

msgctxt "woh_go:29"
msgid "WEIRD CLASSROOM"
msgstr "不気味な教室"

msgctxt "woh_go:30"
msgid "DARK CORRIDOR"
msgstr "暗い廊下"

msgctxt "woh_go:31"
msgid ""
"You sneak in through a window and skulk across the shadowy corridors.\n"
"\n"
"All the classrooms have emptied out. Peering into one, you spot the corpse of a teacher nailed to the chalkboard. Shaking, you approach it."
msgstr ""
"窓から忍び込んだあなたは、\n"
"闇に紛れて暗い廊下を進んでいった。\n"
"\n"
"どの教室も空っぽだ…\n"
"そのうちの一つを覗くと、\n"
"黒板に釘打ちされた\n"
"教師の死体が目に入る。\n"
"震える体を抑えながら、\n"
"あなたは黒板に近寄った。"

msgctxt "woh_go:32"
msgid ""
"You spot an odd bulge protruding from his stomach.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"It writhes against your fingers as you probe it."
msgstr ""
"彼のお腹を見ると、変な膨らみが\n"
"突き出ているのに気付く。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"手で触れると指に反応して、\n"
"何かがくねくねと蠢き始めた…"

msgctxt "woh_go:33"
msgid "PREPARE FOR COMBAT"
msgstr "身構える"

msgctxt "woh_go:34"
msgid "investigate DOWNTOWN twice to complete this quest"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<クリア条件>\n"
"｢中心街｣を\n"
"2回調査する"

msgctxt "woh_go:35"
msgid ""
"With her dying scream, the teacher throws herself into the portal.\n"
"\n"
"Her vicious master shows no mercy - you hear it devour her before the connection shuts."
msgstr ""
"断末魔の叫びとともに、\n"
"異界の扉へ身を投げる教師。\n"
"\n"
"だが、狂暴なる主に慈悲など一切ない。\n"
"扉が閉じる前に、あなたは彼女が\n"
"喰い殺される音を聞いてしまう。"

msgctxt "woh_go:36"
msgid ""
"The confused children lie on the ground crying.\n"
"Thanks to you, however, they are safe.\n"
"\n"
"[TRAGIC TALE OF THE THAUMATURGY TEACHER:\n"
"ENDING A]"
msgstr ""
"混乱した生徒たちが、\n"
"地面に突っ伏して泣いている。\n"
"\n"
"しかし、あなたのおかげで\n"
"彼らは助かったのだ。\n"
"\n"
"｢暗夜に響く妖しき教師の哀れな叫び｣\n"
"Aエンディング"

msgctxt "woh_go:37"
msgid "With her dying scream, the teacher throws herself into the portal - dragging the children with her. Her vicious master shows no mercy - you hear it devour them all before the connection shuts."
msgstr ""
"断末魔の叫びとともに、異界の扉へ身を投げる教師…\n"
"そこに生徒たちも引きずり込まれる。\n"
"\n"
"だが、狂暴なる主に慈悲など一切ない…\n"
"\n"
"扉が閉じる前に、あなたは彼女が\n"
"喰い殺される音を聞いてしまう。"

msgctxt "woh_go:38"
msgid ""
"The children will no longer harm anyone... but their parents will weep for them.\n"
"\n"
"[TRAGIC TALE OF THE THAUMATURGY TEACHER:\n"
"ENDING B]"
msgstr ""
"静寂の中に眠る生徒たち。\n"
"もう誰も傷つけることはないだろう…\n"
"\n"
"しかし、彼らの親の悲痛な叫びは\n"
"闇にこだまし…\n"
"\n"
"｢暗夜に響く妖しき教師の哀れな叫び｣\n"
"Bエンディング"

msgctxt "woh_go:39"
msgid "A - SAVED BY THE BELL"
msgstr "A - 窮地を逃れて"

msgctxt "woh_go:40"
msgid "B - DIABOLICAL DETENTION"
msgstr "B - 悪魔の居残り"

msgctxt "woh_halo:0"
msgid "PREPARING FOR INVESTIGATION"
msgstr "調査準備"

msgctxt "woh_halo:1"
msgid "<<Is there even anything useful left?>>"
msgstr ""
"何か使えそうな物は\n"
"残ってないだろうか？"

msgctxt "woh_halo:2"
msgid "PREPARE"
msgstr "調査準備"

msgctxt "woh_halo:3"
msgid "Looking carefully, you can find character-unique items to help you."
msgstr ""
"よく探すと、探索者の\n"
"専用アイテムが\n"
"見つかることがある。"

msgctxt "woh_halo:4"
msgid ""
"[costs DOOM to enter]\n"
"[unique items]"
msgstr ""
"破滅値上昇\n"
"(専用アイテム入手)"

msgctxt "woh_halo:5"
msgid "KIRIE'S BAG"
msgstr "桐江の鞄"

msgctxt "woh_halo:6"
msgid "(while in inventory): forgetting SPELLS lowers REASON by 1-2 and increases DOOM by 1%, gain a random SPELL"
msgstr ""
"(所持品にある間)\n"
"｢呪文｣を忘れることで\n"
"｢理性｣が1～2減少\n"
"破滅値+1%\n"
"ランダムな｢呪文｣を習得"

msgctxt "woh_halo:7"
msgid "<<I've been collecting these notes for quite some time now.>>"
msgstr "<<だいぶ前から、こういう資料を集めてるの。>>"

msgctxt "woh_halo:8"
msgid "An unseen force guides your hand to the bag..."
msgstr "見えない力に操られ、鞄に手をかける…"

msgctxt "woh_halo:9"
msgid "full of knowledge"
msgstr "知識がぎっしり詰まっている"

msgctxt "woh_halo:10"
msgid "AIKO'S PLUSH TOY"
msgstr "愛子のぬいぐるみ"

msgctxt "woh_halo:11"
msgid ""
"-1 incoming combat damage\n"
"-2 PERCEPTION; -2 LUCK"
msgstr ""
"戦闘時の被ダメージ-1\n"
"｢知覚｣-2\n"
"｢幸運｣-2"

msgctxt "woh_halo:12"
msgid "<<they are not real they are not real they are not real>>"
msgstr "<<本物じゃない 本物じゃない 本物じゃない>>"

msgctxt "woh_halo:13"
msgid "only friend"
msgstr "たった一人の友達"

msgctxt "woh_halo:14"
msgid "CIGARETTE CASE"
msgstr "タバコケース"

msgctxt "woh_halo:15"
msgid "(while in inventory): 15% of regaining one CIGARETTE after investigating a location"
msgstr ""
"(所持品にある間)\n"
"各調査ポイントを調べた後､\n"
"15%の確率で\n"
"｢タバコ｣を1本入手する"

msgctxt "woh_halo:16"
msgid "<<This will stay in my family forever.>>"
msgstr "<<こいつはこれからも、代々うちで受け継がれてく。>>"

msgctxt "woh_halo:17"
msgid "You smoke an old cigarette from your CIGARETTE CASE..."
msgstr "古いたばこを｢タバコケース｣から一本取り出して吸った…"

msgctxt "woh_halo:18"
msgid "grandpa's"
msgstr "じいさんのもの"

msgctxt "woh_halo:19"
msgid "VANITY MIRROR"
msgstr "化粧鏡"

msgctxt "woh_halo:20"
msgid "reveals extra information about event choices"
msgstr ""
"イベントの選択肢に\n"
"追加情報が表示される"

msgctxt "woh_halo:21"
msgid "You can catch glimpses of the future in this tiny mirror..."
msgstr "この小さな鏡を覗き込むと、ほんの少しだけ未来が見える…"

msgctxt "woh_halo:22"
msgid "The VANITY MIRROR will start working next event."
msgstr "次回のイベントから｢化粧鏡｣の効果が発動する。"

msgctxt "woh_halo:23"
msgid "<<I'm so pretty-->>"
msgstr "<<すっごくカワイイわ…瑞希>>"

msgctxt "woh_halo:24"
msgid "FILM ROLL"
msgstr "カメラ用フィルム"

msgctxt "woh_halo:25"
msgid "(use): -1 FUNDS; +10 EXPERIENCE"
msgstr ""
"使用: 所持金-1\n"
"EXP+10"

msgctxt "woh_halo:26"
msgid "<<I can only develop this at a trusted place>>"
msgstr "<<こいつは信頼できるところでしか現像できない…>>"

msgctxt "woh_halo:27"
msgid "You develop the FILM ROLL containing crucial evidence!"
msgstr "あなたは重要な証拠を写したフィルムを現像した。"

msgctxt "woh_halo:28"
msgid "You can't afford that!"
msgstr "そんなお金はない！"

msgctxt "woh_halo:29"
msgid "<<contains evidence ...I think>>"
msgstr "<<ここに証拠が入ってる…はず>>"

msgctxt "woh_halo:30"
msgid "ANATOMY BOOK"
msgstr "解剖学書"

msgctxt "woh_halo:31"
msgid "(use): -2 STAMINA; +8 EXP"
msgstr ""
"使用: ｢スタミナ｣-2\n"
"EXP+8"

msgctxt "woh_halo:32"
msgid "<<I can learn so much studying my own body...>>"
msgstr "<<自分の体を研究すると、すっごく勉強になる…>>"

msgctxt "woh_halo:33"
msgid "Slicing your body open, you learn new things about anatomy..."
msgstr "自分の体を切り開くことで、人体について新たな発見をした…"

msgctxt "woh_halo:34"
msgid "<<I'm ill?>>"
msgstr "<<私、病んでるのかな？>>"

msgctxt "woh_halo:35"
msgid "GUITAR"
msgstr "ギター"

msgctxt "woh_halo:36"
msgid "(while in inventory): resting regains more REASON, increases DOOM"
msgstr ""
"所持品にある間、自宅で休むと\n"
"理性が追加回復し、\n"
"破滅値が上昇する"

msgctxt "woh_halo:37"
msgid "<<I worked all summer to buy this guitar.>>"
msgstr "<<これを買うために、夏休み中ずっと働いていたんだ。>>"

msgctxt "woh_halo:38"
msgid "Your loud guitar practice can be heard across the whole building."
msgstr "建物中に響き渡るほどの大音量でギターの練習をした。"

msgctxt "woh_halo:39"
msgid "HELL YEAH"
msgstr "イエーイ！！"

msgctxt "woh_halo:40"
msgid "BLESSED SHELL"
msgstr "聖なる実包"

msgctxt "woh_halo:41"
msgid "(use in combat): (+1 AMMO / +5% DOOM); +10 SHOOT DAMAGE for the duration of this combat"
msgstr ""
"戦闘時に使用:｢弾薬｣+1\n"
"破滅値+5%\n"
"\n"
"その戦闘での射撃ダメージ+10"

msgctxt "woh_halo:42"
msgid "<<I've loaded it with mom's silver jewelry...>>"
msgstr "<<ママの銀製のアクセサリーを詰めた…>>"

msgctxt "woh_halo:43"
msgid "<<...sorry mom.>>"
msgstr "<<…ごめん、ママ。>>"

msgctxt "woh_halo:44"
msgid "You can't use this outside of combat."
msgstr "戦闘以外では使用できない。"

msgctxt "woh_halo:45"
msgid "<<Should I?...>>"
msgstr "<<使ってもいいよね…？>>"

msgctxt "woh_halo:46"
msgid "MARKED BIBLE"
msgstr "汚れた聖書"

msgctxt "woh_halo:47"
msgid "(while in inventory): resting regains extra REASON/STAMINA, depending on character's FAITH level"
msgstr ""
"(所持品にある間)\n"
"自宅で休んだとき､\n"
"その時の｢信仰値｣に応じて\n"
"｢理性｣｢スタミナ｣が\n"
"追加回復する"

msgctxt "woh_halo:48"
msgid "<<I don't remember certain parts of it, is this real?>>"
msgstr "<<記憶にない一節が…これは本物なのか？>>"

msgctxt "woh_halo:49"
msgid "Reading the MARKED BIBLE, you find your inner peace. (+1 REASON)"
msgstr "｢汚れた聖書｣を読むと、心が落ち着く。(理性+1)"

msgctxt "woh_halo:50"
msgid "MARKED BIBLE fills you with determination. (+1 STAMINA)"
msgstr "｢汚れた聖書｣があなたを奮い立たせる。(スタミナ+1)"

msgctxt "woh_halo:51"
msgid "dies irae"
msgstr "Dies irae"

msgctxt "woh_halo:52"
msgid "AYAKA'S CHALK"
msgstr "彩伽のチョーク"

msgctxt "woh_halo:53"
msgid "+2 DAMAGE against GHOST enemies"
msgstr ""
"[悪霊]の敵に対して\n"
"ダメージ+2"

msgctxt "woh_halo:54"
msgid "<<They died because of me...>>"
msgstr "<<みんな、私のせいで死んだんだ…>>"

msgctxt "woh_halo:55"
msgid "used in rituals"
msgstr "儀式で使ったもの"

msgctxt "woh_halo:56"
msgid "BOOK STRAP"
msgstr "ブックバンド"

msgctxt "woh_halo:57"
msgid "faster combat actions for each BOOK item in the inventory"
msgstr ""
"所持品内に[本]が増えると、\n"
"その分、戦闘アクションが\n"
"速くなる"

msgctxt "woh_halo:58"
msgid "<<That's not the only book I've taken.>>"
msgstr "<<俺が持ち出した本は、あれだけじゃない。>>"

msgctxt "woh_halo:59"
msgid "made of leather"
msgstr "革製"

msgctxt "woh_halo:60"
msgid "CHECK BOOK"
msgstr "小切手帳"

msgctxt "woh_halo:61"
msgid "(use): +3 FUNDS; +4% DOOM"
msgstr ""
"使用: 所持金+3\n"
"破滅値+4%"

msgctxt "woh_halo:62"
msgid "<<Using this will make me easier to track down...>>"
msgstr "<<これを使うと、居場所がバレやすくなっちゃう…>>"

msgctxt "woh_halo:63"
msgid "You've used your CHECK BOOK."
msgstr "あなたは｢小切手帳｣を使った。"

msgctxt "woh_halo:64"
msgid "family's fortune"
msgstr "うちの財産"

msgctxt "woh_halo:65"
msgid "BASEBALL"
msgstr "野球ボール"

msgctxt "woh_halo:66"
msgid "(use in combat): lower the ENEMY's power down to 0"
msgstr ""
"戦闘時に使用すると､\n"
"敵の｢パワー｣が0になる"

msgctxt "woh_halo:67"
msgid "<<I'm not the best pitcher but it must be enough.>>"
msgstr "<<一流の投手ってわけじゃないけど、これで何とかなるはず。>>"

msgctxt "woh_halo:68"
msgid "You throw the BASEBALL at your enemy!"
msgstr "敵に向かって野球ボールを投げつけた！"

msgctxt "woh_halo:69"
msgid "only one I got"
msgstr "あるのはこの一球だけ"

msgctxt "woh_halo:70"
msgid "FAVORITE SNACKS"
msgstr "お気に入りのお菓子"

msgctxt "woh_halo:71"
msgid "(use): +3 REASON and STAMINA"
msgstr ""
"使用: ｢理性｣+3\n"
"｢スタミナ｣+3"

msgctxt "woh_halo:72"
msgid "<<I heard they are going to stop the production of these because they are too damn tasty!-->>"
msgstr "<<あんまりにも美味しいから、生産中止になるんだって！>>"

msgctxt "woh_halo:73"
msgid "You eat your FAVORITE SNACKS."
msgstr "あなたは｢お気に入りのお菓子｣を食べた。"

msgctxt "woh_halo:74"
msgid "yum yum"
msgstr "<<うまうま～>>"

msgctxt "woh_halo:75"
msgid "You rummage through your belongings trying to find anything that will help you."
msgstr ""
"持ち物をかき集めて、\n"
"使えそうな物を探した。"

msgctxt "woh_halo:76"
msgid "You finally pick up"
msgstr "入手アイテム\n"

msgctxt "woh_halo:77"
msgid ""
"Hopefully, it will be enough.\n"
"(+5% DOOM)"
msgstr ""
"役に立てばいいが…\n"
"(破滅値+5%)"

msgctxt "woh_halo:78"
msgid ""
"You don't find anything except some loose change laying around.\n"
"(+1 FUNDS / +2% DOOM)"
msgstr ""
"小銭が転がってるだけで何も出てこない。\n"
"\n"
"所持金+1\n"
"破滅値+2%"

msgctxt "woh_halo:79"
msgid "It's dangerous here, your STAMINA penalty increased!"
msgstr "ここは危険だ…スタミナペナルティが上昇した。"

msgctxt "woh_halo:80"
msgid "It's dangerous here, your REASON penalty increased!"
msgstr "ここは危険だ…理性ペナルティが上昇した。"

msgctxt "woh_halo:81"
msgid ""
"\n"
"[DOOM EFFIGY]: DOOM lowered"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"[呪いの人形]: 破滅値が低下"

msgctxt "woh_halo:82"
msgid "SKIP SUITCASE SCREEN: ON/OFF"
msgstr ""
"スーツケース画面のスキップ\n"
"ON / OFF"

msgctxt "woh_halo:83"
msgid ""
"SKIP CARD PACK SCREEN: ON/OFF\n"
"(all packs enabled)"
msgstr ""
"カードパック画面のスキップ\n"
"(全パックが有効になる)"

msgctxt "woh_halo:84"
msgid "CREEPY NEIGHBOR: ON/OFF"
msgstr "不気味な隣人: ON / OFF"

msgctxt "woh_halo:85"
msgid "CHECK FOR CONNECTED GAMEPADS: ON/OFF"
msgstr ""
"接続中のゲームパッドの確認\n"
"ON / OFF"

msgctxt "woh_halo:86"
msgid "WAVY EFFECT: ON/OFF"
msgstr ""
"ウェーブエフェクト\n"
"ON / OFF"

msgctxt "woh_halo:87"
msgid "SKIP PLAYTHROUGH INTRO"
msgstr "あらすじのシーン: スキップ"

msgctxt "woh_halo:88"
msgid "SKIP MYSTERY TUTORIAL"
msgstr ""
"チュートリアルのスキップ\n"
"ON / OFF"

msgctxt "woh_halo:89"
msgid "MOUSE TRAIL: ON/OFF"
msgstr "マウスストーカー: ON / OFF"

msgctxt "woh_halo:90"
msgid "SKIP PALETTE CUSTOMIZATION"
msgstr ""
"パレットのカスタマイズ画面\n"
"スキップ"

msgctxt "woh_halo:91"
msgid "EXTRA MATH DISPLAYED: ON/OFF"
msgstr ""
"詳細な計算式表示\n"
"ON / OFF"

msgctxt "woh_halo:92"
msgid "EXTRA INFORMATION DISPLAYED: ON/OFF"
msgstr ""
"追加情報の表示\n"
"ON / OFF"

msgctxt "woh_halo:93"
msgid "HOME"
msgstr "自宅"

msgctxt "woh_halo:94"
msgid "DOWNTOWN"
msgstr "中心街"

msgctxt "woh_halo:95"
msgid "SCHOOL"
msgstr "学校"

msgctxt "woh_halo:96"
msgid "HOSPITAL"
msgstr "病院"

msgctxt "woh_halo:97"
msgid "SEASIDE"
msgstr "海辺"

msgctxt "woh_halo:98"
msgid "FOREST"
msgstr "森"

msgctxt "woh_halo:99"
msgid "MANSION"
msgstr "屋敷"

msgctxt "woh_halo:100"
msgid "VILLAGE"
msgstr "村"

msgctxt "woh_halo:101"
msgid "APARTMENTS"
msgstr "アパート"

msgctxt "woh_halo:102"
msgid "TIME PASSED"
msgstr "経過時間"

msgctxt "woh_halo:103"
msgid "SEED"
msgstr "シード"

msgctxt "woh_halo:104"
msgid "LEVEL"
msgstr "レベル"

msgctxt "woh_halo:105"
msgid "IMPENDING DOOM"
msgstr "破滅値"

msgctxt "woh_halo:106"
msgid "select OLD GOD"
msgstr "旧き神の選択"

msgctxt "woh_halo:107"
msgid "AVAILABLE PERKS"
msgstr "獲得可能なパーク"

msgctxt "woh_halo:108"
msgid ""
"You've advanced to the next experience level.\n"
"Choose one perk and one stat upgrade.\n"
"\n"
"[CHOSEN:"
msgstr ""
"EXPを獲得してレベルアップしました。\n"
"パークと強化したい能力値を1つずつ選択してください。\n"
"[選択:"

msgctxt "woh_halo:109"
msgid "(select perk and stat)"
msgstr "(パークと能力値を選択)"

msgctxt "woh_halo:110"
msgid "REROLL PERKS"
msgstr "パークのリロール"

msgctxt "woh_halo:111"
msgid "+4% DOOM"
msgstr "破滅値+4%"

msgctxt "woh_halo:112"
msgid "The group must be there somewhere..."
msgstr "どこかにあの集団がいるはずだ…"

msgctxt "woh_halo:113"
msgid "[click a square to explore it]"
msgstr ""
"四角いアイコンを\n"
"クリックして探索"

msgctxt "woh_halo:114"
msgid "The key to the study must be there somewhere..."
msgstr "どこかに書斎の鍵があるはずだ…"

msgctxt "woh_halo:115"
msgid "[click a mansion's room to explore it]"
msgstr ""
"屋敷内の部屋を\n"
"クリックして探索"

msgctxt "woh_halo:116"
msgid "Where is that gardener?..."
msgstr "あの庭師はどこに…？"

msgctxt "woh_halo:117"
msgid "[extra damage against HUMAN and MONSTER enemies]"
msgstr "｢人間｣｢怪物｣の敵に追加ダメージ"

msgctxt "woh_home:0"
msgid "TURN ON"
msgstr "点ける"

msgctxt "woh_home:1"
msgid "TURN OFF"
msgstr "消す"

msgctxt "woh_home:2"
msgid "TV is turned off."
msgstr "テレビの電源を消した。"

msgctxt "woh_home:3"
msgid "You don't have any VHS cassettes to watch."
msgstr "ビデオを再生するにも、カセットがない。"

msgctxt "woh_home:4"
msgid "(...) Local police are helpless as more and more victims turn up in the downtown area with their throats slashed. (...)"
msgstr ""
"\"---中心街にて、通行人の喉が切り裂かれる事件が相次いで\n"
"発生しておりますが、地元警察による捜査は難航している\n"
"模様です。---\""

msgctxt "woh_home:5"
msgid "(...) demolition of an old inner-city shrine has resulted in an array of unfortunate accidents and, most recently, the death of six people suspected of arson. (...)"
msgstr ""
"\"---中心街にある古い神社の取り壊しにより、不幸な事故が\n"
"相次いで発生しています。\n"
"最近では、放火の疑いがかけられていた６名の容疑者が\n"
"亡くなりました。---\""

msgctxt "woh_home:6"
msgid "(...) we are shocked by what she did. Her voice was always so calm... (...)"
msgstr ""
"\"---彼女のしたことについては私たちも衝撃でした…\n"
"いつも穏やかな声で---\""

msgctxt "woh_home:7"
msgid "(...) the TV host is gutting a big octopus. At least that's what she claims... but there are way too many tentacles (...)"
msgstr ""
"\"---テレビの司会者が大きなタコを捌いている。\n"
"彼女はタコだと言っているが…\n"
"それにしては、あまりにも足の数が多い---\""

msgctxt "woh_home:8"
msgid "(...) local dentist has been found guilty of implanting dog teeth on their human patients - motive is currently unknown. (...)"
msgstr ""
"\"---塩川在住の歯科医が患者に犬の歯を移植していた\n"
"として、有罪判決を受けました。\n"
"未だ、その動機は明らかになっておりません。---\""

msgctxt "woh_home:9"
msgid "(...) a minor earthquake in the seaside region has revealed an entrance to a partially flooded cavern system. Local scientists believe some of the corridors could be man-made. (...)"
msgstr ""
"\"---海辺周辺で発生した微弱な地震により、一部水没した\n"
"洞窟群の入り江が発見されました。\n"
"地元の科学者たちは、この通路の一部が人工的に作られた\n"
"可能性があると指摘しております。---\""

msgctxt "woh_home:10"
msgid "You can't get any signal from the outside world. What is happening?"
msgstr "外からの電波が届いていない…何が起きているのだろう？"

msgctxt "woh_home:11"
msgid "(...) Some of our readers report a strange tall man, dressed in white, taking the metro after dark, apparently stalking lone passengers. Please take care and avoid traveling alone. (...)"
msgstr ""
"\"---夜間の地下鉄内で白い服を着た奇妙な背の高い男が、\n"
"単独の乗客を執拗に追いかけ回しているとの情報が\n"
"一部視聴者様から寄せられています。皆様も安全のため、\n"
"一人での外出は避けるようご注意ください。---\""

msgctxt "woh_home:12"
msgid "(...) once a year, a ramen shop appears where there was once an alleyway - the ramen sold inside is made from its former patrons but can cure any health problem. (...)"
msgstr ""
"\"---かつて路地だった場所に、年に一度だけ現れるという\n"
"ラーメン屋。こちらのお店で提供されるラーメンは、元常連客を使って作られており、どんな病気も治すことができると\n"
"言われています。---\""

msgctxt "woh_home:13"
msgid "(...) the search for a missing person continues in the forest surrounding SHIOKAWA. If you have any information, please contact the police department (...)"
msgstr ""
"\"---塩川周辺の森では、今もなお行方不明者の捜索が続けられています。\n"
"何か情報をお持ちの方は、警察署までご連絡ください。---\""

msgctxt "woh_home:14"
msgid "you don't see anything weird"
msgstr "特に変わったものは見えない…"

msgctxt "woh_home:15"
msgid "what's that?"
msgstr "あれは一体…？"

msgctxt "woh_home:16"
msgid "p-probably just my imagination...."
msgstr "な、何かの気のせいだろう…"

msgctxt "woh_home:17"
msgid "someone is standing in the shadow, watching your door..."
msgstr "何者かが闇に紛れて、じっとこちらのドアを見つめている…"

msgctxt "woh_home:18"
msgid "ENDLESS MODE"
msgstr "エンドレスモード"

msgctxt "woh_home:19"
msgid "CHOOSE A MYSTERY TO INVESTIGATE"
msgstr "調査する謎を選んでください"

msgctxt "woh_home:20"
msgid ""
"Inexplicable and morbid events have been plaguing your town for some time now.\n"
"\n"
"You've marked down five of them, hoping that there is something connecting them.\n"
"\n"
"You can tackle these 5 MYSTERIES in any order you want. Beware, your decisions will haunt you and influence yet unsolved MYSTERIES."
msgstr ""
"不可解な怪奇現象が、この町で\n"
"立て続けに起きている。\n"
"あなたはこれらに何らかの繋がりが\n"
"あると考え、その中でも5つの謎に\n"
"目を付けていた。\n"
"\n"
"この5つの謎は好きな順番で\n"
"調べていくことができます。\n"
"ですが、ご用心ください。\n"
"その決断は未解明の謎にも影響を\n"
"及ぼし、あなたを苦しめることにも\n"
"なるのですから…"

msgctxt "woh_home:21"
msgid "REROLL MYSTERIES"
msgstr "謎のリロール"

msgctxt "woh_home:22"
msgid "ENDINGS DISCOVERED"
msgstr "確認済みのエンディング"

msgctxt "woh_home:23"
msgid "w-what's inside?..."
msgstr "な、中に何が…？"

msgctxt "woh_home:24"
msgid "TAKE THE KEY"
msgstr "鍵を取る"

msgctxt "woh_home:25"
msgid "THEY KNOW"
msgstr "もう逃れられない…"

msgctxt "woh_home:26"
msgid ""
"Inside your mailbox, you find a small key.\n"
"\n"
"What is it doing in there?"
msgstr ""
"郵便受けに小さな鍵が\n"
"入っている。\n"
"\n"
"何でこんなところに…？"

msgctxt "woh_home:27"
msgid "S-someone has crammed your mailbox full of animal entrails..."
msgstr ""
"郵便受けの中に、\n"
"動物の内臓が\n"
"ぎっしりと\n"
"詰め込まれていた…\n"
"\n"
"だ、誰がこんな悪戯を？"

msgctxt "woh_home:28"
msgid ""
"You check your mailbox...\n"
"\n"
"It's empty."
msgstr ""
"郵便受けを調べたが…\n"
"\n"
"中には何もなかった。"

msgctxt "woh_home:29"
msgid "MAILBOX"
msgstr "郵便受け"

msgctxt "woh_home:30"
msgid ""
"They still didn't fix the water problem. It is black and oily and glistening.\n"
"No way you're going to wash yourself in that!"
msgstr ""
"まだ水道が直っていない。\n"
"黒くて油っぽく、ぎらついた水。\n"
"こんなので体を洗えるわけがない！"

msgctxt "woh_home:31"
msgid ""
"The shower will help you calm down and do wonders for your sore muscles.\n"
"What temperature should you set it to?"
msgstr ""
"シャワーを浴びると落ち着くし、筋肉痛も和らぐ。\n"
"温度はどのくらいにしようか？"

msgctxt "woh_home:32"
msgid "You scrub yourself, but you'll never be clean again."
msgstr ""
"必死に体をこすり洗う。\n"
"だが、もう二度と綺麗にはならない。"

msgctxt "woh_home:33"
msgid "COLD WATER (extra REASON regained)"
msgstr "冷たい水 (理性が回復)"

msgctxt "woh_home:34"
msgid "WARM WATER (small EXP boost)"
msgstr "温かいお湯 (EXPをわずかに獲得)"

msgctxt "woh_home:35"
msgid "HOT WATER (extra STAMINA regained)"
msgstr "熱いお湯 (スタミナが回復)"

msgctxt "woh_home:36"
msgid "USE BOTTLED WATER"
msgstr "瓶の水を使う"

msgctxt "woh_home:37"
msgid "fill EMPTY BOTTLE with water"
msgstr "｢空の瓶｣に水を入れる"

msgctxt "woh_home:38"
msgid "(this action requires 'EMPTY BOTTLE' item)"
msgstr "(このアクションを行うには、アイテム｢空の瓶｣が必要)"

msgctxt "woh_home:39"
msgid "You've filled one bottle already."
msgstr "もう瓶には水が入っている。"

msgctxt "woh_home:40"
msgid "YOUR HOME"
msgstr "自宅"

msgctxt "woh_home:41"
msgid "LIGHTHOUSE"
msgstr "灯台"

msgctxt "woh_home:42"
msgid "REST A BIT"
msgstr "少し休む"

msgctxt "woh_home:43"
msgid "TAKE A PEEK THROUGH PEEPHOLE"
msgstr "ドアの覗き穴を見る"

msgctxt "woh_home:44"
msgid "BACK IN YOUR HOME, YOU THINK OF YOUR NEXT MOVE."
msgstr "自宅に戻ったあなたは、次に何をしようかと考えている。"

msgctxt "woh_home:45"
msgid "YOU ARE NOT CURRENTLY INVESTIGATING ANY WEIRD MYSTERY. RECENT NEWSPAPER CLIPPINGS AND NOTES COLLECTED IN THE NEXT ROOM SHOULD POINT YOU IN THE RIGHT DIRECTION."
msgstr ""
"今のところ、奇怪な謎の調査はしていない。\n"
"隣の部屋に、最近出た新聞の切り抜きや資料が集めてある。\n"
"それらを読めば、次に進むべき道が分かるはずだ。"

msgctxt "woh_home:46"
msgid "LIGHT SWITCH"
msgstr "電気を点ける"

msgctxt "woh_home:47"
msgid "WATCH TV"
msgstr "テレビを見る"

msgctxt "woh_home:48"
msgid "TAKE A BATH"
msgstr "風呂に入る"

msgctxt "woh_home:49"
msgid "CHANGE CLOTHES"
msgstr "服を着替える"

msgctxt "woh_home:50"
msgid "START A NEW MYSTERY"
msgstr "新たな謎の調査を始める"

msgctxt "woh_home:51"
msgid "MOVE THE CURTAIN"
msgstr "カーテンの開閉"

msgctxt "woh_home:52"
msgid "OPEN DRAWER"
msgstr "引き出しを開ける"

msgctxt "woh_home:53"
msgid "CLOSE DRAWER"
msgstr "引き出しを閉じる"

msgctxt "woh_home:54"
msgid "CHOOSE AN ACTION"
msgstr "アクションの選択"

msgctxt "woh_home:55"
msgid "You've already taken a bath."
msgstr "お風呂はもう入った。"

msgctxt "woh_home:56"
msgid "Weird, nothing happens."
msgstr "変だな、何も起きない。"

msgctxt "woh_home:57"
msgid "Inside a figurine you find some money. (+1 FUNDS)"
msgstr "フィギュアの中から、お金を見つけた。(所持金+1)"

msgctxt "woh_home:58"
msgid "You stand before a mirror, wondering which outfit to wear."
msgstr "あなたは鏡の前で、どの服を着るか悩んでいる。"

msgctxt "woh_home:59"
msgid "Looking good."
msgstr "イイ感じだ。"

msgctxt "woh_home:60"
msgid "Another day begins..."
msgstr "また新たな一日が始まる…"

msgctxt "woh_home:61"
msgid "Is it going to rain?"
msgstr "雨が降るのだろうか？"

msgctxt "woh_home:62"
msgid "You can't see anything."
msgstr "何も見えない。"

msgctxt "woh_home:63"
msgid "Ominous black clouds circle the lighthouse..."
msgstr "灯台の周りに、不吉な黒い雲が渦巻いている…"

msgctxt "woh_home:64"
msgid "The ghost-gray mist envelops the whole town."
msgstr "得体の知れない灰色の霧が町全体を覆っている。"

msgctxt "woh_home:65"
msgid "It has been raining since morning."
msgstr "朝から雨が降っている。"

msgctxt "woh_home:66"
msgid "It's a nice day outside."
msgstr "外はいい天気だ。"

msgctxt "woh_home:67"
msgid "It's dark already."
msgstr "もう外は暗い。"

msgctxt "woh_home:68"
msgid "GET BACK TO THE TOWN SCREEN"
msgstr "町の画面に戻る"

msgctxt "woh_home:69"
msgid "(complete at least one mystery to save progress)"
msgstr "(進行状況をセーブするには､最低でも1つ､謎を解かなければならない)"

msgctxt "woh_home:70"
msgid "SAVE PROGRESS AND EXIT THE GAME"
msgstr "進行状況をセーブしてゲーム終了"

msgctxt "woh_home:71"
msgid "(you can't save in ENDLESS mode)"
msgstr "(エンドレスモードはセーブ不可)"

msgctxt "woh_home:72"
msgid "You could leave something to charge here."
msgstr "ここに何か充電するものを置ける。"

