msgstr "隣人"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:5"
msgid ""
"Name: KANA\n"
"?? / ?? \n"
"Neighbor has gone missing while investigating a weird case. KANA is determined to find and rescue them."
msgstr ""
"佳那\n"
"？？ / ？\n"
"奇怪な事件を追っていた隣人が、\n"
"調査中に姿を消してしまう。\n"
"佳那はその隣人を見つけ、\n"
"助け出すと決めた。"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:6"
msgid ""
"+ FUN\n"
"- EYE\n"
"starts with SOFT DRINK"
msgstr ""
"楽しさ＋\n"
"眼球－\n"
"｢ソフトドリンク｣を持った状態で\n"
"スタート"

msgctxt "woh_ichi:7"
