msgstr "オニキスの首飾り"

msgctxt "woh_small:493"
msgid ""
"+2 CURSES every mystery\n"
"(once per mystery):\n"
"cure one CURSE"
msgstr ""
"毎回の調査で呪いを2つ付与\n"
"\n"
"謎1つにつき、呪いを1つ解く"

msgctxt "woh_small:494"
msgid "The ONYX MEDALLION burns your skin!"
msgstr "オニキスの首飾りが、あなたの皮膚を焼き尽くす！"

msgctxt "woh_small:495"
msgid "'it fell from the sky'"
msgstr "<<空から降ってきたの…>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:496"
msgid "NECRONOMICON"
msgstr "ネクロノミコン"

msgctxt "woh_small:497"
msgid ""
"-AURA OF AZAL-HOTH-\n"
"\n"
"lower DOOM by 10% by completing a mystery\n"
"[PASSIVE]"
msgstr ""
"-アザル＝ホスの霊気-\n"
"\n"
"謎解明時: 破滅値-10%\n"
"[パッシブ効果]"

msgctxt "woh_small:498"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"retrieve more pages when you level up"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"レベルが上がると、新たなページが手に入る"

msgctxt "woh_small:499"
msgid "BRICK"
msgstr "レンガ"

msgctxt "woh_small:500"
msgid "OLD COIN"
msgstr "古のコイン"

msgctxt "woh_small:501"
msgid ""
"(use): grants one\n"
"free CURSE removal"
msgstr ""
"使用: コストなしで\n"
"｢呪い｣を1つ解く"

msgctxt "woh_small:502"
msgid "You break the coin in half."
msgstr "コインを半分に割った。"

msgctxt "woh_small:503"
msgid "HEAVY DUTY FLASHLIGHT"
msgstr "頑丈な懐中電灯"

msgctxt "woh_small:504"
msgid "[counts as a light source]"
msgstr "[光源]として使える"

msgctxt "woh_small:505"
msgid "MONKEY WRENCH"
msgstr "モンキーレンチ"

msgctxt "woh_small:506"
msgid "[HEAVY TOOL]: -1 STRENGTH"
msgstr "[重い工具]: ｢筋力｣-1"

msgctxt "woh_small:507"
msgid "BRONZE CRUCIFIX"
msgstr "銅の十字架"

msgctxt "woh_small:508"
msgid ""
"(equip): allows you to fight GHOST enemies normally\n"
"(use): break it in half"
msgstr ""
"装備: 通常の戦闘と同じように\n"
"[悪霊]の敵と戦える\n"
"\n"
"使用: 真っ二つに割る"

msgctxt "woh_small:509"
msgid "SKELETON KEY"
msgstr "合い鍵"

msgctxt "woh_small:510"
msgid ""
"(use): open a random remaining LIGHTHOUSE padlock\n"
"COST: 15% DOOM"
msgstr ""
"使用: 灯台に残った南京錠を\n"
"ランダムに開ける\n"
"\n"
"コスト: 破滅値+15%"

msgctxt "woh_small:511"
msgid "HANDCUFFS"
msgstr "手錠"

msgctxt "woh_small:512"
msgid ""
"(while in inventory): lower HUMAN enemy's POWER by 5\n"
"(use): defeat a HUMAN enemy with 12 or less HEALTH remaining"
msgstr ""
"所持品にある間は[人間]の敵の\n"
"｢パワー｣が5低下\n"
"使用: 敵が[人間]で残り｢体力｣\n"
"が12以下だった場合、\n"
"その場で撃破できる"

msgctxt "woh_small:513"
msgid "You subdue the weakened enemy!"
msgstr "弱った敵を力ずくで抑えた！"

msgctxt "woh_small:514"
msgid "RUSTY SICKLE"
msgstr "錆びた鎌"

msgctxt "woh_small:515"
msgid "[small chance of dealing 1 extra DAMAGE]"
msgstr ""
"低確率で追加ダメージを\n"
"1与える"

msgctxt "woh_small:516"
msgid "FOREST NOTE"
msgstr "森に残されたメモ"

msgctxt "woh_small:517"
msgid ""
"I write this for everyone wanting to stay behind.\n"
"\n"
"The sacrifice is worth it.\n"
"Life's meaning comes from our relationships.\n"
"Share death, and that connection will outlast you.\n"
"\n"
"There won't be anything left but US."
msgstr ""
"これはこの世界に残ろうとする\n"
"全ての人々に向けて書いた\n"
"ものだ。\n"
"この犠牲は無駄にならない。\n"
"人生の意味とは、人と人との\n"
"つながりの中から生まれる。\n"
"共に死を分かち合おう。\n"
"そのつながりは、君が消えた後も続く。\n"
"最後に残るのは我々だけだ。"

msgctxt "woh_small:518"
msgid ""
"Everyone here is waiting for you so if you lose your resolve\n"
"\n"
"just listen to the VOICE OF HUMANITY"
msgstr ""
"皆がここで君を待っている。\n"
"仮にその意志が揺らぐことが\n"
"あれば…\n"
"\n"
"｢全人類の声｣に耳を傾ければいい。"

msgctxt "woh_small:519"
msgid "GOBLET (BLOOD)"
msgstr "血の杯"

msgctxt "woh_small:520"
msgid ""
"[constantly cold to the touch]\n"
"(use): drink the blood"
msgstr ""
"[触るといつも冷たい]\n"
"\n"
"使用: その血を飲み干す"

msgctxt "woh_small:521"
msgid "It looks ancient. What was it doing in school?..."
msgstr "見た目はかなり古い。なぜ学校にあったのだろう…？"

msgctxt "woh_small:522"
msgid "The blood drunk from the goblet is surprisingly cold and smooth."
msgstr "杯に注がれた血を飲み干す。驚くほど冷たく、なめらかに感じる。"

msgctxt "woh_small:523"
msgid "It rejuvenates you and clears your mind. (+6 STAMINA / +6 REASON)"
msgstr ""
"すると、元気が出てきて晴れやかな気持ちになった。\n"
"(スタミナ+6 / 理性+6)"

msgctxt "woh_small:524"
msgid "BOTTLE [BLOOD]"
msgstr "血の入った瓶"

msgctxt "woh_small:525"
msgid ""
"(use): drink the blood\n"
"[filled with boiling blood]"
msgstr ""
"使用: その血を飲み干す\n"
"[煮え立つ血で満たされている]"

msgctxt "woh_small:526"
msgid "OCCULT DIARY"
msgstr "オカルト日記"

msgctxt "woh_small:527"
msgid "(use): -3% DOOM"
msgstr "使用: 破滅値-3%"

msgctxt "woh_small:528"
msgid "You burn the cursed diary. (-3% DOOM)"
msgstr "呪いの日記を焼き払った。(破滅値-3%)"

msgctxt "woh_small:529"
msgid "RITUAL MASK (PUMPKIN)"
msgstr "儀式の仮面(南瓜)"

msgctxt "woh_small:530"
msgid ""
"(use): cook and eat it\n"
"[small chance of ignoring REASON loss in combat]"
msgstr ""
"使用: 調理して食べる\n"
"低確率で戦闘中に\n"
"｢理性｣が下がるのを防ぐ"

msgctxt "woh_small:531"
msgid "Ghastly pale yellow in color."
msgstr "不気味に黄ばんだ仮面。"

msgctxt "woh_small:532"
msgid "RITUAL MASK protects you from the attack!"
msgstr "｢儀式の仮面｣が敵の攻撃を防いだ！"

msgctxt "woh_small:533"
msgid "Tasty! (+2 STAMINA)"
msgstr "美味い！(スタミナ+2)"

msgctxt "woh_small:534"
msgid "creepy"
msgstr "不気味な柄"

msgctxt "woh_small:535"
msgid "SPIRAL HOOD"
msgstr "うずまき柄の覆面"

msgctxt "woh_small:536"
msgid ""
"+2 STRENGTH / DEXTERITY\n"
" -2 PERCEPTION"
msgstr ""
"｢筋力｣+2 / ｢敏捷性｣+2\n"
"｢知覚｣-2"

msgctxt "woh_small:537"
msgid "creepy"
msgstr "気色悪い"

msgctxt "woh_small:538"
msgid "CHAINSAW"
msgstr "チェーンソー"

msgctxt "woh_small:539"
msgid "[HEAVY TOOL]: -1 STRENGTH"
msgstr "[重い工具]: ｢筋力｣-1"

msgctxt "woh_small:540"
msgid "SWITCHBLADE"
msgstr "飛び出しナイフ"

msgctxt "woh_small:541"
msgid "BRICK"
msgstr "レンガ"

msgctxt "woh_small:542"
msgid "LUCKY BAT"
msgstr "幸運のバット"

msgctxt "woh_small:543"
msgid "+2 LUCK"
msgstr "｢幸運｣+2"

msgctxt "woh_small:544"
msgid "You can't find anything useful in the notes. You throw them away."
msgstr "有用な情報が見つからなかったので、そのまま捨てた。"

msgctxt "woh_small:545"
msgid "The forbidden knowledge transcribed on the notes sear your brain... (-2 REASON)"
msgstr "そこに転写された禁断の知識を目にし、脳が焼かれてしまう…(理性-2)"

msgctxt "woh_small:546"
msgid "Using a pocket knife, you escape! (-4% DOOM)"
msgstr "ポケットナイフを使い、その場から逃げた！(破滅値-4%)"

msgctxt "woh_small:547"
msgid "Even with a pocket knife, you won't be able to escape!"
msgstr "ポケットナイフがあっても、その場を逃げ切れない！"

msgctxt "woh_small:548"
msgid "You fill the prescription and recieve a drug."
msgstr "あなたは処方箋を出して、薬を受け取った。"

msgctxt "woh_small:549"
msgid "Now, where would you find the girl who dropped it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_small:550"
msgid "You don't have enough money!"
msgstr "お金が足りない！"

msgctxt "woh_small:551"
msgid "This action requires a HUMAN enemy!"
msgstr "このアクションは[人間]の敵にのみ有効。"

msgctxt "woh_small:552"
msgid "This action requires a PLANT enemy!"
msgstr "このアクションは[植物]の敵にのみ有効。"

msgctxt "woh_small:553"
msgid "Your faith is crumbling! (-7 FAITH)"
msgstr "神への信仰心が崩れ落ちていく。(信仰値-7)"

msgctxt "woh_small:554"
msgid "You've already equipped"
msgstr "すでに装備中:"

msgctxt "woh_small:555"
msgid "HOSPITAL PASS"
msgstr "病院の入館証"

msgctxt "woh_small:556"
msgid "[allows you to skip some encounters at the HOSPITAL]"
msgstr ""
"病院でのエンカウントを\n"
"一部スキップできる"

msgctxt "woh_small:557"
msgid "An obvious forgery but it should be enough to fool the overworked staff at the hospital."
msgstr "偽物感がすごいが、疲れ切った職員をダマすならこれで十分だろう。"

msgctxt "woh_small:558"
msgid "'an obvious forgery'"
msgstr "明らかに偽物"

msgctxt "woh_small:559"
msgid "SEMI-AUTO"
msgstr "半自動式拳銃"

msgctxt "woh_small:560"
msgid "[damage when shot: 7]"
msgstr "射撃時の与ダメージ: 7"

msgctxt "woh_small:561"
msgid "A pistol smuggled into Japan. Still in good condition."
msgstr "日本に密輸された拳銃。状態もまだ良い。"

msgctxt "woh_small:562"
msgid "why did you do it?..."
msgstr "なぜこんなことを…"

msgctxt "woh_small:563"
msgid "ARM SLING"
msgstr "うで吊り"

msgctxt "woh_small:564"
msgid "+4 STAMINA"
msgstr "｢スタミナ｣+4"

msgctxt "woh_small:565"
msgid "You should let your arm rest a bit before taking it off."
msgstr "少し腕を休ませてから外そう。"

msgctxt "woh_small:566"
msgid "a temporary solution"
msgstr "応急処置"

msgctxt "woh_small:567"
msgid "ROSARY"
msgstr "ロザリオ"

msgctxt "woh_small:568"
msgid ""
"(equip): +3 FAITH\n"
"+1 REASON"
msgstr ""
"装備: ｢信仰｣+3\n"
"｢理性｣+1"

msgctxt "woh_small:569"
msgid "An old wooden rosary."
msgstr "古い木製のロザリオ。"

msgctxt "woh_small:570"
msgid "<<Glory Be>>"
msgstr "<<光あれ>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:571"
msgid "CHAINSAW (NO FUEL)"
msgstr "チェーンソー(燃料切れ)"

msgctxt "woh_small:572"
msgid "[needs fuel to be functional again]"
msgstr ""
"再始動させるには\n"
"｢燃料｣が必要"

msgctxt "woh_small:573"
msgid "A deadly tool... if you can manage to make it run again."
msgstr "また動かせるようになれば…恐ろしい凶器になり得る。"

msgctxt "woh_small:574"
msgid "<<...>>"
msgstr "<<…>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:575"
msgid "FUEL"
msgstr "燃料"

msgctxt "woh_small:576"
msgid "(use): attempt to refill something that runs on gasoline"
msgstr ""
"使用: ガソリンで動くものに\n"
"補充する"

msgctxt "woh_small:577"
msgid "A heavy can filled with fuel."
msgstr "燃料が入った重い容器。"

msgctxt "woh_small:578"
msgid "You refuel the chainsaw, making it usable again. Groovy."
msgstr "チェーンソーに燃料を補充し、また使えるようにする。良い音だ！"

msgctxt "woh_small:579"
msgid "You don't have anything that needs refueling."
msgstr "｢燃料｣が必要なものを所持していない。"

msgctxt "woh_small:580"
msgid "<<...>>"
msgstr "<<…>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:581"
msgid "CHAINSAW"
msgstr "チェーンソー"

msgctxt "woh_small:582"
msgid "Now that it's properly fueled, it should last you for a long time."
msgstr "燃料は十分入れたので、しばらくは安心して使える。"

msgctxt "woh_small:583"
msgid "a brutal weapon"
msgstr "残酷な武器"

msgctxt "woh_small:584"
msgid "RESEARCH NOTES"
msgstr "研究資料"

msgctxt "woh_small:585"
msgid "(...) The pillars are related to the cult of T(...), a fertility goddess. People here refuse to help us with the work and forbid us from researching the village's archives. (...)"
msgstr ""
"“---これらの柱は豊穣の女神、テ---の信仰と関係していた。\n"
"村民は我々、研究員に対する協力を拒み、村にある古文書の調査を禁じたのである。---”"

msgctxt "woh_small:586"
msgid "You nearly trip over a brick laying on the floor."
msgstr "床に置かれたレンガに危うくつまずきそうになる。"

msgctxt "woh_small:587"
msgid "You decide to pick it up."
msgstr "手に取ってみることにした。"

msgctxt "woh_small:588"
msgid "You throw the pack of cigarettes away."
msgstr "タバコの箱を捨てた。"

msgctxt "woh_small:589"
msgid ""
"-AURA OF AZAL-HOTH-\n"
"\n"
"<<the cult can't be allowed to have this cursed book!>>\n"
"\n"
"completing a mystery lowers DOOM by 10%\n"
"[PASSIVE]"
msgstr ""
"-アザル＝ホスの霊気-\n"
"\n"
"<<あんなカルト集団に、\n"
"この呪いの書が渡ったら\n"
"とんでもないことに…！>>\n"
"\n"
"謎を解くごとに\n"
"破滅値が10%低下\n"
"[パッシブ効果]"

msgctxt "woh_small:590"
msgid ""
"The NECRONOMICON you've stolen contains powerful spells and horrible secrets.\n"
"To activate its power, retrieve more pages when you level up."
msgstr ""
"あなたが盗み出したこの本\n"
"には、強力な呪文や恐ろしい秘密が記されている。\n"
"その力を引き出すには、\n"
"レベルを上げて新たなページを集めなければならない。"

msgctxt "woh_small:591"
msgid "The power of RAGH-ZHULL fills you! (+1 DAMAGE)"
msgstr "“ラグ＝ズール”の力がその身に宿った！(ダメージ+1)"

msgctxt "woh_small:592"
msgid "F'THOTH cleanses your surroundings! (-3% DOOM)"
msgstr "“フ･トス”によって、あなたの周りが浄化された！(破滅値-3%)"

msgctxt "woh_small:593"
msgid "You don't have enough experience!"
msgstr "EXPが足りない！"

msgctxt "woh_small:594"
msgid "SHEBBE cares deeply for her followers!"
msgstr "“シェベ”が信仰者に対し、深い愛情を注いだ！"

msgctxt "woh_small:595"
msgid "So it shall be done. (+15% DOOM)"
msgstr "全てはその意のままに。(破滅値+15%)"

msgctxt "woh_small:596"
msgid "CTHUR-IZTO mends your flesh! (+3 STAMINA / +3 REASON)"
msgstr "“クトゥル＝イズト”があなたの肉体を修復した！(スタミナ+3 / 理性+3)"

msgctxt "woh_small:597"
msgid ""
"is trembling with fear.\n"
"<<P-please, don't make me attack t-them.>>"
msgstr ""
"は恐怖で震えている。\n"
"<<た、頼むから、奴らを襲わせないで…>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:598"
msgid ""
"gulps and clenches their fists.\n"
" <<w-we'll make it out of this alive, for sure!>>"
msgstr ""
"がごくりと唾を飲み込み、拳を握った。\n"
"<<ぜ、絶対に生きて、ここを抜け出す！>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:599"
msgid "barks knowingly."
msgstr "が、何かを理解したかのように吠えた。"

msgctxt "woh_small:600"
msgid "is wagging its tail."
msgstr "は、しっぽをフリフリと振っている。"

msgctxt "woh_small:601"
msgid "looks at you as you pat its head."
msgstr "の頭をナデナデすると、あなたの方を見つめてきた。"

msgctxt "woh_small:602"
msgid ""
"looks around, uncertain.\n"
"\n"
"<<Let's get out of this forest, okay?>>"
msgstr ""
"が、不安そうに辺りを見回す。\n"
"\n"
"<<もう、この森は出た方がいい…>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:603"
msgid ""
"suddenly stops.\n"
"\n"
"<<W-what was that noise?...>>"
msgstr ""
"が、急に立ち止まった。\n"
"\n"
"<<な…何の音…？>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:604"
msgid ""
"smiles a bit.\n"
"\n"
"<<At least the weather is nice.>>"
msgstr ""
"が微笑んだ。\n"
"\n"
"<<まあ…天気はいいね。>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:605"
msgid ""
"shivers.\n"
"\n"
"<<I don't like the way the villagers look at us...>>"
msgstr ""
"が体を震わせる。\n"
"\n"
"<<村の人の視線が、どうも気になる…>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:606"
msgid ""
"gets closer.\n"
"\n"
"<<Should we be wearing masks? It looks like everyone else is...>>"
msgstr ""
"が近づいてくる。\n"
"\n"
"<<…仮面、どうする？\n"
"つけてないのは自分たちだけじゃ…？>>"

msgctxt "woh_small:607"
msgid ""
"looks around.\n"
"\n"
"<<We spent one summer vacation in this village a few years ago.>>"
msgstr ""
